The spoken audio is generated locally from the German quest text with
Voxtral 4B TTS (Mistral AI, mistralai/Voxtral-4B-TTS-2603), released under
CC BY-NC 4.0. The audio it produces carries that licence, so this sound pack
and the engine addon it belongs to are given away and may not be sold. That is
the whole of what non-commercial costs here, and it was chosen with the cost
known: the readers that permit commercial use were measurably worse in German.

The German quest text is Blizzard Entertainment's, read from the World of
Warcraft Game Data API under the project's own credentials, and every clip in
this pack is spoken from those records and from nothing else.

The voices are the reader's own. Mistral removed the audio encoder from the
open weights, so this reader cannot be given a voice and nothing here is cloned
from anybody: the two used are its built-in presets, one German female and one
neutral male. No recording of any person is distributed with this addon.

